  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We Effect Sustainable Watering Systems and Value Chains 2025-2027 - We Effect Watering Systems and Value Chains 2025-2027</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">We Effect Sustainable Watering Systems and Value Chains 2025-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Bidraget syftar till att &#xf6;ka produktiviteten och l&#xf6;nsamheten inom odlingssystem f&#xf6;r kaffe, kakao, kardemumma och gr&#xf6;nsaker genom att fr&#xe4;mja bevattningstj&#xe4;nster och erbjuda teknisk assistans till jordbrukare i Guatemala.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution seeks to enhance the productivity and profitability of coffee, cocoa, cardamom, and vegetable farming systems by promoting irrigation services and providing technical assistance to farmers in Guatemala.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">General Objective: To increase productivity and profitability of inclusive agri-food systems, from a global green transition approach and the promotion of economic development and trade as means to overcome poverty.

Specific Objective: To sustainably increase the incomes of women and men producers through resilient production systems, inclusive agroforestry and agri-food value chains, and access to high-value markets.</narrative>
  </description>
